OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment begins paying off
OL,4,Acouncil's #2bn debt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has officially begun
OL,7,Freducing the debt pile of a Surrey
OL,8,Flocal authority.
OL,10,FOfficials have started paying down
OL,11,F#500m of Woking Borough Council's
OL,12,Fhistoric #2bn debt.
OL,14,FThe authority will be replaced by the
OL,15,Fnew West Surrey Council in April 2027
OL,16,Ffollowing the dissolution of Surrey
OL,17,FCounty Council and its 11 boroughs and
OL,18,Fdistricts as part of local government
OL,19,Freorganisation.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
